  <work>
    <work-title>欢乐颂：小提琴与钢琴完整编曲 / Ode to Joy</work-title>
  </work>
  <identification>
    <creator type="composer">L. van Beethoven · arr. Music Viewer</creator>
    <rights>Beethoven hymn theme; Peter Chubb, Mutopia-2009/08/05-528 (public domain). Music Viewer complete independent violin/piano arrangement: introduction, full violin theme, full piano response with violin counterpoint, written-out melodic variation, and coda. This is not the full fourth movement of Symphony No. 9. Music Viewer 完整器乐编曲：前奏、完整圣歌主题、钢琴答奏、终段实音变奏与尾声；不是第九交响曲第四乐章全长版。</rights>
  </identification>
